            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "attrs" : {
                        "url" : "http://stackoverflow.com/questions/23919515/how-to-convert-from-utf-16-to-utf-32-on-linux-with-std-library"
                     },
                     "type" : "inlineCard"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : " ",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : " ",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "       for other direction",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : " ",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "              ",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "attrs" : {
                        "url" : "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/UTF-16#Encoding_of_characters_outside_the_BMP"
                     },
                     "type" : "inlineCard"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : " ",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : " ",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "       FINALLY FIX STTRING/CHARACTER UNICODE STUFF 99%",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : " ",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "       >>> string design todo",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "              Length () returns number of UTC32 characters.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "              A[i] returns character (always in UTF32) – so redo character using UTF32;",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "              Still have String () store in wchar_t and have c_str() return wchar_t* (may want to sometday reverse this but its livable)",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "      '",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "AT SAME TIME - implement related trick of having a rep/impl that stores data as UTF-8. ",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "THIS IS MAYBE NOT so well thought out. ",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "I GUESS I could do what is described above mostly. But key is what I actually store. Cuz thats the only thing I can return raw ptr of.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            }
         ],
